ABOUT = '<main id="sxa-main"><section class="sxa-page-hero"><div class="sxa-container"><span class="sxa-eyebrow">About Scale Xpert</span><h1 class="sxa-display">SEO services grounded in <span class="sxa-gradient">real website work.</span></h1><p class="sxa-copy">We help businesses decide what to fix, publish and measure. Alongside client work, our Discord and Reddit spaces give website owners and SEO practitioners a place to exchange practical ideas.</p><div class="sxa-actions"><a href="contact.html" class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--primary">Discuss your website ↗</a><a href="#community" class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--ghost">Get to know the community ↓</a></div></div></section>\n<section class="sxa-section"><div class="sxa-container sxa-split"><div><span class="sxa-eyebrow">Where we started</span><h2 class="sxa-h2">It began with a backlink problem.</h2><p class="sxa-copy">Cold outreach took time and often led to poor-fit sites. Marketplaces gave smaller teams little context about who they were working with. Scale Xpert began as a place for website owners and SEO practitioners to talk directly about their sites, audiences and possible collaborations.</p><p class="sxa-copy">The same questions now shape our agency work. What stops the right people from finding a site? Which pages deserve attention first? What evidence will show whether the work helped?</p></div><div class="sxa-feature-panel"><h3>What guides Scale Xpert</h3><ul class="sxa-list"><li><strong>Clarity:</strong> explain the reason behind every priority.</li><li><strong>Relevance:</strong> match content and opportunities to the right audience.</li><li><strong>Trust:</strong> value useful relationships over volume.</li><li><strong>Accountability:</strong> document what was done and review what changed.</li></ul></div></div></section>\n<section class="sxa-section sxa-section--soft"><div class="sxa-container"><div class="sxa-section-head"><div><span class="sxa-eyebrow">The agency</span><h2 class="sxa-h2">How we approach <span class="sxa-gradient">a new website.</span></h2></div><p class="sxa-copy">We look at the pages, technical access and available search data before recommending content or authority work.</p></div><div class="sxa-card-grid"><article class="sxa-card"><span class="sxa-card-index">01 / UNDERSTAND</span><h3 class="sxa-h3">Investigate the website</h3><p>Review technical access, content quality, search intent, and where visitors need clearer information.</p></article><article class="sxa-card"><span class="sxa-card-index">02 / IMPROVE</span><h3 class="sxa-h3">Do the useful work</h3><p>Prioritize relevant fixes, page improvements, and authority opportunities against an agreed scope.</p></article><article class="sxa-card"><span class="sxa-card-index">03 / LEARN</span><h3 class="sxa-h3">Measure and adapt</h3><p>Use reporting to discuss visibility, qualified visits, and what the next decisions should be.</p></article></div><div class="sxa-actions"><a class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--ghost" href="services.html">Explore SEO services ↗</a></div></div></section>\n<section id="community" class="sxa-section sxa-about-community" aria-labelledby="sxa-about-community-title"><div class="sxa-container"><div class="sxa-community-heading"><div><span class="sxa-eyebrow">The community</span><h2 id="sxa-about-community-title" class="sxa-h2">Two spaces for people working on real websites.</h2><p class="sxa-copy">Scale Xpert began by making it easier for site owners and SEO practitioners to meet, compare fit and discuss useful collaboration. The community now spans direct conversation on Discord and public discussion on Reddit.</p></div><div class="sxa-community-reach sxa-community-reach--about"><span class="sxa-community-reach-label">Reddit visibility</span><strong>6M+</strong><p>views generated by our posts</p><small>Team-reported cumulative post views; not site visits, leads or client outcomes.</small></div></div><div class="sxa-channel-grid"><article class="sxa-channel-card"><div class="sxa-channel-top"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/66e3d7f4ef6498ac018f2c55_Symbol.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="lazy"><span>01 / DISCORD</span></div><h3>Connect with a relevant peer.</h3><p>Introduce your website and niche, talk through content ideas and compare whether a guest post or link partnership makes sense for both audiences.</p><ul><li>Share the site and topics you cover</li><li>Discuss fit before agreeing to a placement</li><li>Keep the conversation direct and transparent</li></ul><a class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--primary" href="https://discord.com/invite/M7yJtvh2Yr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join Discord <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article><article class="sxa-channel-card sxa-channel-card--reddit"><div class="sxa-channel-top"><img src="https://www.redditstatic.com/desktop2x/img/favicon/favicon-32x32.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="lazy"><span>02 / REDDIT</span></div><h3>Put an SEO question in the open.</h3><p>Read and join discussions about technical SEO, content, Search Console, link quality and how search is changing. Members can compare approaches in public.</p><ul><li>Ask specific questions and share experience</li><li>Read the community rules before posting links</li><li>Keep promotion relevant and avoid spam</li></ul><a class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--ghost" href="https://www.reddit.com/r/SEO_Xpert/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore r/SEO_Xpert <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></div><h2 class="sxa-h2" style="margin-top:45px">How Scale-Xpert Helps You Build Backlinks</h2><div class="sxa-preserved-benefits"><article class="sxa-preserved-benefit"><span class="sxa-eyebrow">01</span><h3>Finding Backlink Partners Faster</h3><p class="sxa-copy">Instead of emailing hundreds of websites, users meet site owners who are already open to collaboration.</p></article><article class="sxa-preserved-benefit"><span class="sxa-eyebrow">02</span><h3>Improving Link Relevance</h3><p class="sxa-copy">Members compare niches, traffic, and authority before deciding whether a backlink opportunity makes sense.</p></article><article class="sxa-preserved-benefit"><span class="sxa-eyebrow">03</span><h3>Supporting Guest Posting</h3><p class="sxa-copy">The community supports backlink and guest post exchanges that help users earn contextual links.</p></article><article class="sxa-preserved-benefit"><span class="sxa-eyebrow">04</span><h3>Relationship-Based SEO</h3><p class="sxa-copy">Scale-Xpert encourages relationships, link-worthy content, outreach, and long-term collaboration.</p></article><article class="sxa-preserved-benefit"><span class="sxa-eyebrow">05</span><h3>Quality Over Quantity</h3><p class="sxa-copy">Strong backlinks come from relevant, authoritative websites, appear naturally, and provide real reader value.</p></article></div>\n<div class="sxa-preserved-join"><h2 class="sxa-h2">Start building backlinks with trusted SEO peers</h2><div class="sxa-steps"><article class="sxa-step"><span class="sxa-step-number">1</span><h3>Join the Discord</h3><p class="sxa-copy">Enter the community and choose your interest.</p></article><article class="sxa-step"><span class="sxa-step-number">2</span><h3>Share your website</h3><p class="sxa-copy">Share your site, niche, and SEO metrics like DA, DR, or traffic.</p></article><article class="sxa-step"><span class="sxa-step-number">3</span><h3>Receive your backlink opportunities</h3><p class="sxa-copy">Connect with website owners and agree on backlink placements directly.</p></article></div><p class="sxa-preserved-bonus">Bonus: New members can receive their first 3 backlink opportunities.</p><div class="sxa-actions"><a class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--primary" href="https://discord.com/invite/M7yJtvh2Yr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join the Community</a><a class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--ghost" href="https://www.reddit.com/r/SEO_Xpert/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Reddit Community</a></div></div>\n<div class="sxa-community-how"><div><span class="sxa-eyebrow">How to take part</span><h3>Start with context. Then find the right conversation.</h3></div><ol><li><strong>Tell people what your site covers.</strong> Niche, audience and the pages you are working on help others judge relevance.</li><li><strong>Compare ideas before links.</strong> A collaboration should make editorial sense for readers on both websites.</li><li><strong>Follow the channel rules.</strong> The subreddit requires website links and SEO service promotions to be introduced in Discord first.</li></ol></div></div></section>\n<section class="sxa-section sxa-section--soft"><div class="sxa-container sxa-split"><div><span class="sxa-eyebrow">The team</span><h2 class="sxa-h2">Bring us a URL and the question you need answered.</h2><p class="sxa-copy">We can review the pages involved, explain which issues need attention and put the proposed work in writing.</p><div class="sxa-actions"><a class="sxa-btn sxa-btn--primary" href="contact.html">Start a conversation ↗</a></div></div><div class="sxa-feature-panel"><h3>What to bring to the first conversation</h3><ul class="sxa-list"><li>Your website and target market.</li><li>The pages or search challenges you care about most.</li><li>Any data or previous work you want us to review.</li></ul></div></div></section></main>'

